  <details class="fold" id="gsm-friend" style="margin:6px 0 16px"><summary>WORKING WITH A FRIEND</summary><ol class="steps"><li><span>1</span><div>Each of you writes your own name in the name box.</div></li><li><span>2</span><div>Answer on your own, then choose Save workbook. A file downloads.</div></li><li><span>3</span><div>Send your file to your friend (email, message, or a shared folder).</div></li><li><span>4</span><div>Your friend chooses Combine with another workbook and picks your file. Your answers and notes appear next to theirs, with your name.</div></li><li><span>5</span><div>They save and send theirs back, and you combine again. Combining again with the same person updates their answers and adds only what is new.</div></li></ol><div class="whohelp">Moved dots and hidden links in the figures are not carried across. Links added in Patterns are.</div></details>
